This project's BatchNorm rescaling strategy and default fp32 op block list are
informed by prior art:

* onnxconverter-common (MIT, Microsoft) — `float16.convert_float_to_float16`,
  including the `max_finite_val` clamp and the default op block list.
  https://github.com/microsoft/onnxconverter-common
* ONNX Runtime (MIT, Microsoft) — `onnxruntime.tools.convert_onnx_models_to_float16`
  and the operator kernels that define which ops run in fp16.
  https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime

